==============================================================================
Does Contrite TFT raise the epsilon ceiling? (D-028)
==============================================================================
D-028 argues the ceiling near epsilon = 0.15 is about error-handling,
not about noise as such. Contrite TFT is the one pool entry that
handles its OWN error correctly - it accepts a punishment it provoked
instead of answering it. If that mechanism is what the ceiling is
about, adding it should move the ceiling. If not, the ceiling is
about something else, and that is the more interesting answer.

